{"story_id":42950,"updated_at":"2026-10-24T16:21:01","headline_en":"India beats New Zealand by four wickets in second T20I match","headline_hi":"भारत ने दूसरे टी20 अंतरराष्ट्रीय मैच में न्यू जीलैंड को चार विकेट से हराया।","payload_en":{"story_id":42950,"headline":"India beats New Zealand by four wickets in second T20I match","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Gulf News","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":42950,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-24T16:21:01","category":{"primary":["life"],"secondary":["sport-films"]},"places":[],"people":["Abhishek Sharma","Rohit Sharma","New Zealand","Mitchell Santner","Nitish Kumar Reddy","Christchurch","Matt Henry","Tilak Varma"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"Abhishek Sharma reached the milestone of 100 T20I powerplay sixes during India's second T20I against New Zealand in Christchurch on Saturday 24 October 2026.","ids":[67545],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"Abhishek Sharma became the third Indian batter to reach over 1,000 T20I runs in a calendar year, totaling 1,012 runs across 36 T20I innings this year following his T20I debut in 2024.","ids":[67554,67555,67560],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"Abhishek Sharma holds the record for the fastest T20I century by a batter from a full-member nation, and holds an average of 28.91 and a strike rate of 199.60.","ids":[67578,67580,67581],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"India won the second T20I against New Zealand and won the match with one ball remaining on Saturday 24 October 2026.","ids":[67544,67549],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"India won the toss and chose to bowl first on Saturday 24 October 2026.","ids":[67547],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"On Saturday, Nitish Kumar Reddy hit the winning runs for India.","ids":[67563],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Abhishek Sharma reached the milestone with a six off Matt Henry.","ids":[67564],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"On Saturday, Abhishek Sharma failed to turn his initial start into a substantial score.","ids":[67574],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Abhishek Sharma scored 27 off 21 balls before falling to Mitchell Santner in the ninth over on Saturday.","ids":[67546],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"New Zealand finished their innings on 180/5 in 20 overs on Saturday 24 October 2026.","ids":[67548],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"India beat New Zealand by four wickets on Saturday 24 October 2026.","ids":[67559],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Tilak Varma struck six fours and a six while India was chasing 180 on Saturday, scoring an unbeaten 51 off 26 balls.","ids":[67562,67567],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Abhishek Sharma has a career average of one powerplay six every 7.77 balls in T20Is.","ids":[67550],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Abhishek Sharma surpassed Rohit Sharma's record of 98 powerplay sixes.","ids":[67565],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Nitish Kumar Reddy remained unbeaten on 26 runs.","ids":[67576],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Mitchell Santner finished with bowling figures of 4/21.","ids":[67577],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"India was struggling at 112/6 in the 15th over while chasing 180.","ids":[67575],"class":"single","sources":[2]}]],"section_keys":["news","background","background","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","performers","performers","performers","performers","performers","performers","performers","performers","numbers"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://gulfnews.com/sport/cricket/abhishek-sharma-becomes-first-batter-to-hit-100-t20i-powerplay-sixes-1.500722411","outlet":"Gulf News","title":"Abhishek Sharma becomes first batter to hit 100 T20I powerplay sixes","perspective":"–","read":tru